From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilya Vysotsky <il.mohoff2016@yandex.ru>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 07:00:34 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] Build system: an arm-uwp target

--enable-uwp and the 32-bit ARM Windows toolchain: clang-cl for thumbv7,
armasm, an SDK with ARM32 libraries, the app-container CRT, the custom
Rust target, and the moz.build files that decide what is built for it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
